Z||000010||Tigger||10-31-2001||12:20 PM||||You could also use tables to separate the images.  Instead of using imagemaps just make each image a link.  Imagemaps are great if you want to use one picture for several links.<P>Check out <A HREF="http://www.webmonkey.com" TARGET=_blank>www.webmonkey.com</A>   You should find a section and examples on how to create imagemaps.<P>Opps, you beat me to it.  Looks like you got imagemaps to work!<P>HUH??     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  Wierd, I'm looking at the post times and the last post I saw in this thread was AusFiero's before I posted.   It only took me 5 minutes to post my message....  or was it?  Strange.<P>Doo bee doo be doooo    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-31-2001).]||||reg||1
